      Resolved &lt;time title=&quot;26 June 2023 at 06:04&quot; datetime=&quot;2023-06-26T06:04:43Z&quot;&gt;about 3 years ago&lt;/time&gt; by &lt;a class=&quot;mw-100 d-inline-block align-bottom text-truncate text-wrap&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; href=&quot;https://www.openstreetmap.org/user/vasony&quot;&gt;vasony&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;note-comment-text&quot;&gt;ez esetben ha nincs élvezeti értéke, akkor ezt zárjuk le, mert nem szükséges felvinni / 
      Reactivated &lt;time title=&quot;28 June 2023 at 19:10&quot; datetime=&quot;2023-06-28T19:10:59Z&quot;&gt;about 3 years ago&lt;/time&gt; by &lt;a class=&quot;mw-100 d-inline-block align-bottom text-truncate text-wrap&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; href=&quot;https://www.openstreetmap.org/user/utvonalfelmeresek&quot;&gt;utvonalfelmeresek&lt;/a&gt;
